@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho

actor "Third-Party Source" as Source

component "Webhook Ingestion" as Ingestion
component "Validation & Event Recorder" as Validator
component "Delivery / Target Router" as Delivery
component "Retry Manager" as Retry
component "Dead-Letter Queue & Event Store" as Store
component "Logging & Monitoring" as Logs
component "Target Internal Service" as Target

interface "Webhook Input" as I1
interface "Validated Event" as I2
interface "Delivery API" as I3
interface "Retry State" as I4
interface "Event Storage" as I5
interface "Log / Status" as I6

Source - I1
I1 - Ingestion
Ingestion ..> Validator : <<use>>
Validator - I2
I2 - Delivery
Delivery ..> Target : <<use>>
Delivery ..> Retry : failed delivery
Retry - I4
I4 - Store
Retry ..> Delivery : exponential backoff retry
Delivery ..> Logs : attempts / responses
Validator ..> Logs : validation status
Ingestion ..> Logs : accepted payload
Store - I5
Store ..> Logs : DLQ / recovery status

note right of Ingestion
Buffers inbound webhooks
for high-throughput ingestion.
end note

note right of Retry
Retries failed deliveries
using exponential backoff.
end note

note right of Store
Preserves accepted events
and retry state; stores events
that exceed retry limit.
end note

@enduml
